/data/imports/

# macOS folder metadata and Word's lock files. Never intentional.
.DS_Store
~$*.doc*

# The internal business report. This repository is PUBLIC, and the document
# heads itself «سند فرماندهی داخلی · محرمانه» — it carries revenue, annual
# cost, competitor-by-competitor analysis and the pricing arithmetic. Publish
# a commit containing it and it is public permanently, whatever a later commit
# removes. It lives on disk and in Notion; not here.
/docs/11-business-report.*
